# PLAN-892 a2r-hir B13 — daily emit golden compare through the real
# A2X chain (core profile). The certification leg for this case runs
# the explicit certify axis (reference-B13.rs vs the closed-form
# oracle), not this daily check.

```test-case
case {
  schema: "autolang.case/2"
  id: "a2r-hir-892.b13-overflow"
  tags: ["a2r-hir", "four-file", "core", "trap"]
  links: ["PLAN-892"]
  source: { file: "src/B13.at", syntax: "auto", path: "main.at" }
  entry: { mode: "program" }
  checks: [
    { id: "a2x-emit", adapter: "probe", action: "run",
      options: {
        recipe: "ac-a2r/hir-scalar-emit-v1",
        a2x_hir: { profile: "core", entry: "main" },
        steps: [{ op: "run" }]
      },
      expect: { completion: "success", artifacts: [
        { path: "main.rs", file: "golden-B13/main.rs", compare: "bytes" },
        { path: "a2x_runtime.rs", file: "golden-B13/a2x_runtime.rs", compare: "bytes" },
        { path: "generated.rs", file: "golden-B13/generated.rs", compare: "bytes" },
        { path: "manifest.json", file: "golden-B13/manifest.json", compare: "bytes" }
      ] } }
  ]
}
```
